Hello,

I'm getting the following WARNING in my log pretty frequently on my
system (Debian Lenny on a DL320G5) when connectivity is provided with a
bridge interface with eth0 (tg3) attached. System feels a bit sluggish
as well. I did not experience any problems when using eth0 directly.

Happened with both 2.6.26-1-amd64 from Debian and a vanilla 2.6.27, I'm
attaching dmesg and config.

The same warning has been reported in February but received no response
http://thread.gmane.org/gmane.linux.network/85727

